---
import SectionHead from './SectionHead.astro';
import WorriesBand from './WorriesBand.astro';
---

<section class="sec" id="problem" aria-labelledby="problem-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <SectionHead no="01" label="The problem" id="problem-h">
      A warm pallet costs more than <em class="hl">the freight bill.</em>
      <p slot="lead" data-reveal>
        Cold freight has no room for a bad day. One delivery outside its range and the product's rejected, your
        customer's unhappy, and you're the one explaining. It's rarely the truck. It's a driver who doesn't know the
        site, a check nobody did, or a delay nobody mentioned.
      </p>
    </SectionHead>
  </div>
  <WorriesBand />
</section>
